    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d178-a1">

                <pb facs="0328" n="236" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg236"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hart to Mr. Paul</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States of America.</hi><lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October
                                24, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The circumstances of the case compel me to
                    recall to your excellency’s attention my note of October 6, in the matter of the
                    Panama Star and Herald claim, and to ask that your excellency favor me with a
                    definite reply thereto, in order that I may cable the same to my Government on
                    or before Wednesday the 26th instant, it being the desire of my Government to
                    close this incident without further delay.</p>
                <p>I improve this opportunity to renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chas. Burdett
                    Hart.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
